## Import

Using `terraform import`, import the Object Storage bucket using the format: `<user-id>/<bucket-name>`. For example:

{{ codefile "shell" .ImportFile }}

For imported buckets, the resource configuration must describe immutable creation settings returned by the API. For example:

```terraform
resource "xelon_object_storage_bucket" "imported" {
  name                       = "existing-bucket"
  user_id                    = "existing-user-id"
  object_lock_enabled        = true
  object_lock_retention_days = 30
  versioning_enabled         = true
}
```
